---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout 
  title="About Sanjeeb Chetri | Founder & Principal Search Strategist | askaseo"
  description="Meet Sanjeeb Kumar Chetri, Founder & Principal Search Strategist at askaseo. ~5 years scaling B2B SaaS, e-commerce, and enterprise search architecture."
>
  <div class="py-20 md:py-28 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <!-- Hero Header -->
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center space-y-4 mb-20">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400 bg-cyan-500/10 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/20">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400 animate-ping"></span>
        Founder & Principal Search Strategist
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Meet <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-400 via-indigo-200 to-cyan-400">Sanjeeb Kumar Chetri</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-base sm:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        Property owner and lead search engineer at <strong class="text-white font-semibold">askaseo</strong>. Senior SEO Specialist with ~5 years of battle-tested experience driving high-converting search pipeline.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Main Profile Card & Story -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-start mb-24">
      
      <!-- Left: Founder Bio & Philosophy -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-8">
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/[0.04] to-white/[0.01] border border-white/[0.08] shadow-2xl space-y-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">
            Engineering Search into Predictable Revenue
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              I am a Senior SEO Specialist and full-stack search operator with nearly five years of experience spanning B2B SaaS, agency, and e-commerce. For the past 3+ years, I have owned organic growth across multiple B2B SaaS properties at <strong>Vantage Circle</strong>, managing a multi-property portfolio generating over <strong>130M+ annual search impressions</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Under my search leadership, organic-led channels have generated <strong class="text-white font-semibold">~80% of company closed-won revenue</strong>. Unlike traditional agencies that chase vanity traffic, my focus is strictly on commercial intent, revenue-per-session, and technical search durability.
            </p>
            <p>
              I am also an active pioneer in the new era of generative search: generating <strong class="text-cyan-400 font-semibold">834K+ impressions in Google's AI Overviews (AIO)</strong> within the first 3.5 months of tracking, while establishing AI assistants (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Claude, Gemini) as tracked, converting acquisition channels in GA4.
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- Quick Stat Highlights -->
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 pt-6 border-t border-white/[0.08]">
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#05070c] border border-white/[0.06]">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-white">~80%</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Closed-Won Revenue Attributable to Organic</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#05070c] border border-white/[0.06]">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-cyan-400">834K+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Google AI Overviews Impressions</div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-3.5 rounded-xl bg-[#05070c] border border-white/[0.06] col-span-2 sm:col-span-1">
              <div class="text-2xl font-black text-emerald-400">130M+</div>
              <div class="text-xs text-slate-400 mt-0.5">Annual Search Impressions Managed</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Career Milestones -->
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Proven Leadership & Experience</h3>
          
          <div class="space-y-4">
            <!-- Role 1 -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] space-y-2">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 gap-1">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-base">Senior SEO Specialist &bull; Vantage Circle</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-cyan-400">Dec 2022 – Present (3+ yrs)</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Promoted to Senior SEO Specialist in April 2025. Spearhead full technical architecture, international hreflang across French, German, and Spanish markets, log-file / N-gram / fan-out analysis, and AI search workflows across multiple B2B SaaS properties.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Role 2 -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] space-y-2">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 gap-1">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-base">SEO Specialist &bull; Ekodus Technologies</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-slate-400">Aug 2022 – Dec 2022</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Managed search strategy and local ranking performance for high-profile real estate and health enterprise accounts.
              </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Role 3 -->
            <div class="rounded-2xl p-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] space-y-2">
              <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between text-xs text-slate-400 gap-1">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-base">Digital Marketing Executive &bull; Lotus Traders</span>
                <span class="font-mono text-slate-400">Nov 2021 – Jul 2022</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
                Developed e-commerce platforms and directed end-to-end technical on-page search indexing and structured content.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Direct Operator Card, Certifications & Contact -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 space-y-6">
        
        <!-- Contact & Direct Access Card -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0c101c] via-[#090d16] to-[#07090e] border border-white/[0.1] shadow-2xl space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-tr from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-cyan-400 p-[2px] shadow-lg shadow-indigo-500/25">
              <div class="w-full h-full bg-[#0a0d14] rounded-[14px] flex items-center justify-center font-black text-xl text-white">
                SC
              </div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-white">Sanjeeb Kumar Chetri</h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-cyan-400 font-semibold">Founder & Lead SEO Engineer</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">Guwahati, Assam, India</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="space-y-3 pt-2 text-xs sm:text-sm border-t border-white/[0.06]">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 shrink-0">✉</span>
              <a href="mailto:sanjeebchetri9999@gmail.com" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition truncate">sanjeebchetri9999@gmail.com</a>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 shrink-0">📍</span>
              <span>Guwahati, Assam, India</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-slate-300">
              <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-400 shrink-0">in</span>
              <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/sanjeebchetri" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hover:text-cyan-400 transition">linkedin.com/in/sanjeebchetri</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-2">
            <a 
              href="/#free-audit" 
              class="w-full flex items-center justify-center gap-2 py-3.5 px-6 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-cyan-500 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-cyan-400 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all hover:scale-[1.02] border border-white/20"
            >
              <span>Work Directly with Sanjeeb</span>
              <span>→</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Specialized Certifications -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] space-y-4">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Specialized Credentials</h4>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Semantic SEO Masterclass</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-400">Certified by Koray Tuğberk Gübür (Topical Authority Framework)</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">Google Analytics Certified (GA4)</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-400">Measurement, custom events, and LLM-referral attribution</span>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5">
              <span class="text-emerald-400 mt-0.5 font-bold">✓</span>
              <div>
                <strong class="text-white block">PGDIBO & B.Com</strong>
                <span class="text-slate-400">Post Graduate Diploma in International Business Operations (IGNOU)</span>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Technical Tooling Matrix -->
        <div class="rounded-3xl p-6 bg-white/[0.02] border border-white/[0.06] space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Technical Operator Stack</h4>
          <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-300">
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Log-File Analysis</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">N-Gram & Fan-Out</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Google AI Overviews (AIO)</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Ahrefs & Semrush</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Screaming Frog</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">DataForSEO API</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Claude Code & MCP</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">n8n Automation</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Astro Framework</span>
            <span class="px-2.5 py-1 bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.06] rounded-md">Python & HTML/CSS</span>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Final CTA Banner -->
    <div class="rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-950/70 via-[#0b0e1a] to-[#07090e] border border-indigo-500/30 text-center space-y-6">
      <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-white">
        Ready to Work Directly with a Principal Search Strategist?
      </h3>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
        No account manager handoffs. You get direct access to Sanjeeb Chetri to audit your domain, solve technical indexing blocks, and build lasting organic pipeline.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 pt-2">
        <a 
          href="/#free-audit" 
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-bold text-xs sm:text-sm text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-indigo-600 via-indigo-500 to-cyan-500 hover:from-indigo-500 hover:to-cyan-400 shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/30 transition-all hover:scale-105 border border-white/20"
        >
          Claim Free 30-Point Audit
        </a>
        <a 
          href="/contact" 
          class="w-full sm:w-auto px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-semibold text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-300 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.05] hover:bg-white/[0.1] border border-white/[0.1] transition"
        >
          Schedule Strategy Call
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</MainLayout>
